        "en": "Patient and friendly grooming staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently applaud the grooming crew for their warm attitude, patience, and welcoming reception. Customers frequently mention individual groomers who take extra time to calm nervous pets and guide anxious owners through the bath routine. Pet parents appreciate that staff members handle difficult temperaments with kindness and composure."
      }
    },
    {
