      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable rates for regular baths"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Affordability stands out as a primary highlight across customer reviews. Pet owners frequently describe the pricing as lower than standard valley rates, making routine grooming and bath visits accessible. Many long-term visitors mention returning every few weeks because the overall cost remains fair and consistent without hidden surcharges."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Neat haircuts and clean styling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report very satisfying styling results, noting that dogs and cats leave looking clean and smelling fresh. Owners of poodles specifically praise the precision of the haircuts and even coat trims. While one reviewer expressed safety concerns regarding handling during a visit, most feedback highlights neat and dependable grooming outcomes."
      }
    }
  ],
